<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63662" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λῐχᾰνός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λείχω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>licking</i>: <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὁ λ.</span>,
			with or without <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δάκτυλος</span>,
				<i>forefinger</i>, from its use in licking up, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Art.</u>
				37
			</span></i>,al., <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>Tim.</u>
				54
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				1.15d
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PLips.</u>
				12.9
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii A. D.)</span>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> as Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λίχᾰνος</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορδή</span>), ἡ,
				<i>the string struck with the forefinger</i>, and <i>its
			note</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Aristox.
				<u>Harm.</u>
				p.116
			</span></i> M., <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				919a17
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				3.59
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.1029a
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			Adj., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λ. σωλήν</span>
			<i>a tube of the alembic</i>, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
				pp.225,236
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i></div>
